To port irsim to linux I changed some makefiles and options. I also made
some cosmetic changes to src/utils/Export/export.c, just to get it to compile.
This release is modified to look for X11 libraries in /usr/X11R6/lib or
/usr/X386/lib.

If irsim doesn't compile/run on your machine, I try to help as much as I
can.

Installation:

You have to have csh/tcsh to compile irsim. Set CAD_HOME environment
variable to point to the place where you want the simulator installed. It
will create $CAD_HOME/bin, $CAD_HOME/man and $CAD_HOME/doc/irsim and install
itself there.

